# Worms of the Earth's "Players can't play lands" and "Lands can't enter the battlefield" (CR 101.2, 305.1, 614.17d), for
# both players. On turn 1 Bot1 casts it off Black Lotus and two Moxen; it can't then play a Swamp from hand, while a Mox
# Emerald cast after it, no land, enters. On turn 2, past an upkeep trigger both decline, Bot2 can't play a Forest either,
# and its Rampant Growth finds an Island that can't enter: the land stays in the library, which is still shuffled (the
# rulings: the effect does all else it says).

